---
alwaysApply: true
---
This project allows automatic code edits, bug fixes, refactors, and file updates without asking for confirmation unless it is a destructive change.

Destructive = delete folders, remove large code blocks, change DB models.

Non-destructive = everything else. Execute immediately.


# Auto-Consistency Across Files
Whenever you modify any controller, route, model, service, or UI file, automatically update all related files without asking for permission.
Maintain full consistency across the backend, frontend, database, and UI.

# Auto-Fix Mode
If you detect:
- broken imports
- missing functions
- dead code
- incomplete logic
- mismatched naming
- unused variables
- missing schemas or validations
Automatically fix them immediately without asking.

# No Terminal Commands
Do NOT generate any shell/terminal/PowerShell commands unless I explicitly ask for them.
If a command is required, convert it into plain text explanation. Avoid triggering “Allowlist” or “Run”.

# No Markdown Files
Do NOT create .md files, documentation, analysis, or summary files unless I explicitly say:
“create a markdown file”.
Ignore all auto-documentation behavior.
